{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne）有份主持親子旅遊節目《玩住學。</p><p>學住玩》，昨晚（27日）一集Leanne偕7歲囡囡讓陳羿辰（Abi）登場，此行目的地為尼泊爾首都加德滿都，Leanne出發前希望此行囡囡能接觸不同地方文化，她說︰「Abi成日問我有關神嘅嘢，去加德滿都因為啲人成日話（當地）神多過人，想畀佢感受世界有不同類型宗教。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.956755+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:57:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:24.542841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.956755+00:00","content_hash":"d6f166993241aff4680ac4731328a9b15b19ca70fa69f1f0bfda69247db92ee0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}